      "writtenOn": "2020-12-30T07:05:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We should not use this because it makes it puts arbitrary paths on the include paths list without telling the build system what the code actually depends on. This probably makes it difficult or impossible for the build system to provide safety guarantees.\n\nWe should instead put an explicit dependency into shared_libs (or, if the library is only headers, into header_libs). Not sure what target this would be. libbpf_android?",
