      "writtenOn": "2021-01-04T16:40:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hmm, we just need to use one header file (BpfUtils.h) which is included in libbpf_android_headers. But it don\u0027t have sdk_version which means we can\u0027t easily just put into tethering module. In order word, we need to make that header library and its dependencies libraries(android-base) have sdk version.\n\nGiving that we just need some inline function(syscall wrapper) in BpfUtils.h. How about just add those syscall(with fd just use int) into this JNI ? WDYT ?",
